{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29784","headline":"摇落 · 李商隐","name":"摇落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇落伤年日，羁留念远心。\n水亭吟断续，月幌梦飞沈。\n古木含风久，疎萤怯露深。\n人闲始遥夜，地迥更清砧。\n结爱曾伤晚，端忧复至今。\n未谙沧海路，何处玉山岑？\n滩激黄牛暮，云屯白帝阴。\n遥知沾洒意，不减欲分襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}